{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally a Florist is a cozy, slice-of-life florist simulator!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753270/extras/5846c980dda12fa9e1d61836729b8c31.avif?t=1772760683\" width=634 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Mo, a recently retired professional who has always wanted to be a florist. Pulled now to support his town by making bouquets for various occasions, get a sneak peek into people's lives as you celebrate all life has to offer.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore new biomes, collect flowers, and arrange bouquets to fit your customer's needs. The town is counting on you to become the florist you've always dreamed.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish quests, unlock recipes, and befriend animals in this point-and-click, wholesome adventure.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3753270?t=1772760683","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3753270?t=1772760683","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753270/1381cb99b275c1743beda8729b9d43f202c82620/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772760683","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753270/1381cb99b275c1743beda8729b9d43f202c82620/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772760683","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally a Florist is a cozy, slice-of-life florist simulator!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.